  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 47 D 25 A 5 C 2 B 9 = ?\n\n47 D 25 A 5 C 2 B 9 = ? ⇒ 47 - 25 ÷ 5 + 2 × 9 = ?\n\n⇒ 47 - __**25 **____**÷**____** 5**__ + 2 × 9 = ?\n\n⇒ 47 - 5 + __**2 **____**×**____** 9**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**47 + 18**__ - 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**6**____**5 - 5**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 60 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
